lder="Answer"></span> of city centre</p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>STOP C:</p></td><td><p>Museum</p></td><td></td><td><p>• bookshop specialising in the</p><p class="native-text-row"><span class="native-gap ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">17</strong><input type="text" name="single_listening_30_17" aria-label="Question 17" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Answer"></span> of the local area</p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>STOP D:</p></td><td><p>Entertainment Complex</p></td><td></td><td><p class="native-text-row">• <span class="native-gap ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">18</strong><input type="text" name="single_listening_30_18" aria-label="Question 18" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Answer"></span> cinema • bowling alley • video games arcade</p></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>Questions 19 and 20</h2><p>Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p><p>19 How often do the Top Bus Company tours run?</p><p class="native-text-row"><span class="native-gap ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">19</strong><input type="text" name="single_listening_30_19" aria-label="Question 19" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Answer"></span></p><p>20 Where can you catch a Number One Sightseeing Tour from?</p><p class="native-text-row"><span class="native-gap ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">20</strong><input type="text" name="single_listening_30_20" aria-label="Question 20" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Answer"></span></p></div>7:[["$","$L12","single-listening-30",{"test":{"id":"single-listening-30","resource":"listening","practiceFormat":"single","test":30,"title":"Section 2 · Exercise 10","backUrl":"/?view=listening&format=single&part=2","durationMinutes":7,"audioScope":"section","parts":[{"id":2,"passage":"$13","transcriptStatus":"asr-draft","questions":"$14","fieldNames":[